                  "external/cert/obligation/rule"
                ],
                "description": "Replacement implementations of operator delete should override the variants both\n              with and without std::size_t, otherwise it violates the 'Required behavior' clause\n              from the C++ Standard.",
                "id": "cpp/cert/operator-delete-missing-partner-cert",
                "kind": "problem",
                "name": "MEM55-CPP: Replacement operator delete missing partner",
                "precision": "very-high",
